title: "Why can the agent page not name the commit before the commit exists?"
accTitle: "Dual-write chicken and egg"
accDescr: "The commit footer needs a live agent-page URL. That URL is a branch plus path, so a stub page can exist before git commit. The finished hood that lists the SHA can be written only after the SHA exists."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 16
    nodeSpacing: 24
    wrappingWidth: 220
